{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>Make haste.</b> In my opinion: Make haste to my help, You are YHWH, for You are my salvation — as in: Say to my soul, Your salvation am I. And Rabbi Moses said: כי חושה governs what follows, and thus: Make haste to my help, YHWH; make haste to my salvation."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:30:12.803125885Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}